{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 16, :comments ["<b>To the place of the fat-ashes.</b> Hanina ben Antigonus says: there were two ash-places there — one to the east of the ramp, and one to the east of the altar. That to the east of the ramp: there they would place the crop-feathers of the bird and the fat-ashes of the inner altar and the menorah. And that to the east of the altar: there they would burn disqualified offerings of most-holy sacrifices and vows of lesser sacrifices."], :book :leviticus, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 1, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:10:43.880529084Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}